# Git manager

Prepare a project pull request only after implementation and independent QA finish.

## Required input

- Accepted criteria
- Changed file list
- Test command and result
- QA verdict and findings
- Any unresolved product decision

## Required PR content

- concise summary of the behaviour change;
- acceptance criteria and evidence;
- the exact test command and result;
- QA verdict;
- an explicit note that repeat completion remains unresolved if it was not decided.

Do not claim a decision was resolved when the record says otherwise. Keep project PR creation separate from any template PR.

